  "description": "TOLQIY crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H78 Dy5 N9 O37,2(C2 H3 N1),10(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.671-3.986 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.59-112.62°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy5(HL1)2(L1)4(μ3-OH)2(NO3)3]·2CH3CN·10H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
